  "sourceTitle": "Autumn Corn Bake",
  "sourceText": "Autumn Corn Bake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 12:24am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pkt (10-oz) frozen corn, thawed, drained\n1/2 pound Velveeta pasteurized process cheese spread, cubed\n1/4 cup Cornmeal\n1 Egg, beaten\n2 tablespoons Parkay margarine, melted\n2 tablespoons Finely chopped green pepper\n1 dsh Pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine ingredients; mix well. Spoon into 1-1/2-quart casserole; cover. 2 Bake at 350 degrees, 45 minutes. 6 servings.",
